<title>ROMANIA: Romanian unemployment 7.2 pct in March vs 7.1.</title>
<headline>Romanian unemployment 7.2 pct in March vs 7.1.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Romania's jobless rate rose slightly to 7.2 percent in March from 7.1 percent the previous month, the Labour Ministry reported on Monday.</p>
<p>The number of unemployment benefit claimants was up some 9,600 to 757,723, it said.</p>
<p>				   MARCH     FEBRUARY  MARCH 1996</p>
<p> Number unemployed	  757,723    748,115   1.031 million</p>
<p> Pct of workforce	     7.2	   7.1	 9.2</p>
<p>NOTE -- Romania's workforce is 10.491 million. Labour Ministry officials said around 90,000 people would lose their jobs this year as restructuring gathers pace.</p>
<p>-- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
</text>
